# Outputs are the verification workspace

## Rule

All task-generated candidate deliverables MUST be placed in an `outputs/` workspace and remain there during build, testing and verification. The precise organization beneath `outputs/` is defined by the applicable workflow or task executor, not by this requirement.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
